I started working in the Data & AI space as a technologist since 2019.
Having started my career in a tech consultancy, I have taken on a wide variety of roles across multiple industries (FMCG, banking, automotive).

I really enjoy mathematical optimisation problems and I wish their reputation in the tech industry is as good as AI.

## Projects
- [BabySprout](https://github.com/JessieW-FSD/Baby-Sprout), an iOS app to help parents log and monitor their babies' routine.
